# Assignment 6 – Browser Fingerprinting (Denisov)

This folder contains my solution for Assignment 6 (CS 433/533 Web Security, Fall 2025).

## Code

- `server.js` – Express server that fingerprints clients based on HTTP request headers and IP address.
- `fingerprints.log` – server-side log of all seen fingerprints (used for screenshots and analysis).
- `fingerprints.json` – simple JSON “database” that remembers known clients (firstSeen, count, headers).

